{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Control AI Before it Controls You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ESCAPE CONDITION is the first game that lets you take control of society's future amidst the AI revolution. Use messages from the Future Resistance to identify the AI Branches that will change your world - then decide the fate of each branch. <br><br><br>Choose how technology should advance - are machines meant to be our masters or our slaves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391580/extras/AboutthisGame_Technology.png?t=1742391582\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose how chaotic society should be - is power meant to be centralized or decentralized?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391580/extras/AboutthisGame_Chaos.png?t=1742391582\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose how the environment should be treated - does human progress come first at the expense of nature?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391580/extras/AboutthisGame_Pollution.png?t=1742391582\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1391580?t=1742391582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742391582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391580/df391a82d2cd818ca863cfaa4aeb69b5a19386ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742391582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1391580/df391a82d2cd818ca863cfaa4aeb69b5a19386ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742391582","categories":[{"description